{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe evening light on the Rhine is quite something. The river is thick with large two-masted vessels, moving with a purpose that reminds one of the state’s own machinery. I have spent the day wandering the churches, admiring the stone. It is impressive, though one must look past the mere material to see the spirit it houses.\n\nFor Sunday, I intend to attend Mass in the cathedral with the young Counts Stolberg and their tutor, Dean Kellermann. The music is said to be excellent. I must be careful, however, not to let the aesthetic subsume the ethical. We are here to observe the religious life of the people, not merely to be entertained.\n\nI hope the boys are well-behaved and that you are finding the Berlin air agreeable. I shall leave for Aachen this afternoon. Pray for my safe passage.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080094,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":192,"prompt_tokens":938,"total_tokens":1130,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-MQFaGSm3yX5BIRXRrWB8vUrlyDvFWsD3","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":938,"prompt_ms":956.504,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.019727078891258,"prompt_per_second":980.6545503207515,"predicted_n":192,"predicted_ms":4511.609,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.620989528795814,"predicted_per_second":42.335228961552296}}